Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.00,Default,,0,0,0,,SPEAKER_00: Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.00,0:00:12.00,Default,,0,0,0,,SPEAKER_00: I just want to say my name is Chang and this is my grandfather, Mr. Lee.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.00,0:00:18.00,Default,,0,0,0,,SPEAKER_00: I didn't get your name.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.00,0:00:24.00,Default,,0,0,0,,SPEAKER_00: I guess you didn't, did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.00,0:00:32.00,Default,,0,0,0,,SPEAKER_00: Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.00,0:00:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,SPEAKER_00: Another one, honey. Same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.00,0:00:58.00,Default,,0,0,0,,SPEAKER_00: Double?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.00,0:01:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,SPEAKER_00: Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.00,0:01:02.00,Default,,0,0,0,,SPEAKER_00: You sure about that, Doc?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.00,0:01:04.00,Default,,0,0,0,,SPEAKER_00: You can drink the doubles all night.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.00,0:01:06.00,Default,,0,0,0,,SPEAKER_00: All right. Make it a triple.
